OL,3,GNEWSAMacklemore begins Free Palestine
OL,4,Atour after Ed Sheeran fallout
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacklemore has begun his Free Palestine
OL,7,Ftour in Dublin after Ed Sheeran's
OL,8,Fcontroversial decision to drop the
OL,9,Frapper from his tour last month.
OL,11,FThe American star is playing to a crowd
OL,12,Fof up to 13,000 at the city's 3Arena -
OL,13,Fand, hours before the sell-out show,
OL,14,Fhad promised "many incredible surprise
OL,15,Fguests".
OL,17,FThe artist - whose real name is
OL,18,FBenjamin Haggerty - announced the tour
OL,19,Fdays after being dropped from Sheeran's
OL,20,FLoop Tour following pro-Palestinian
OL,21,Fcomments he made onstage.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
