OL,3,GNEWSAMacklemore begins Free Palestine
OL,4,Atour after Ed Sheeran fallout
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was criticised by Jewish groups
OL,7,Fafter saying "Free Palestine" at two
OL,8,Fconcerts and making political speeches,
OL,9,Fincluding referring to the death toll
OL,10,Ffrom Israel's military action in Gaza
OL,11,Fas a genocide - a claim that Israel
OL,12,Frejects.
